00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:16.900
So, they finally asked
if we could get some

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:21.280
and make a whole candy platter
of all these crazy candies.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.120
It's a hundred percent my fault.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:26.840
I'm showing them videos
of awesome looking candy

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.020
and then expecting that
they're not going to want it.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:32.007
Yeah. Right. So, I
should have known better

00:04:32.007 --> 00:04:35.693
