excuse to try it, too.

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:38.903
- Try our magic potion.

00:04:40.803 --> 00:04:41.636
(whistle)

00:04:41.636 --> 00:04:43.010
Sour.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:43.960
- Cotton candy. Mm.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:46.433
