00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.190
Weird. Swabs are cool

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:53.447
because you can just make
your own shape lollipop. Mm.

00:04:54.616 --> 00:04:56.449
- It's a gummy tomato.

00:04:57.328 --> 00:05:00.660
