teeth brushing session

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.029
after all that sugar and they were

00:05:03.029 --> 00:05:05.900
over the top hyper the rest of the day.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:08.100
I really couldn't tell
if they were on to me.

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.260
I don't think they fully realized

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:10.730
