00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:14.820
Wyatt has made a dare request.

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:16.216
What did you ask for?

00:05:16.216 --> 00:05:17.893
- Grass pizza.

00:05:17.893 --> 00:05:18.822
- Grass pizza.

00:05:18.822 --> 00:05:19.989
- Grass pizza?

