00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:05.123
- All right.

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:10.567
Oh, hi honey. You want some?

00:06:10.567 --> 00:06:12.984
(jazz music)

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:16.574
You like it?

00:06:16.574 --> 00:06:17.843
- Grass pizza.

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:23.380
- So Jackson asked, where
are we sleeping tonight?

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:24.811
- In the trailer!

00:06:24.811 --> 00:06:25.900
- In the trailer.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:28.990
- One weekend when I was
gone with the kids, Matt went

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.860
and bought a travel trailer.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.110
Here's Ziggy.

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:35.910
I wanted one for so long.
I just think they're so fun

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:40.810
and portable and cute
and so multifunctional-

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.920
that I've really wanted one forever.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.650
We named it Ziggy because

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:46.580
it has the cute little lightning bolt.

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.660
And it's just perfect.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.320
So when Jackson requested

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:52.170
