00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:55.430
I got very excited because
it would be my first time.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:59.630
Okay. Here we are. In Ziggy the trailer.

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:01.560
The boys initially wanted all of us to

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:04.670
sleep in there, but Henry
really couldn't sleep in there.

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:08.010
There was no room for all of
us. So Matt stayed in the house

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:11.290
