something big was coming.

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:21.760
I just didn't have any
clue what it would be.

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:24.040
Where did we go Jackson? It was so cool.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.139
We're at the beach.

00:10:25.139 --> 00:10:26.638
We went to the beach!

00:10:26.638 --> 00:10:27.471
