Going to the beach is a lot
of work when you have kids.

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:36.930
But this time I couldn't say no.

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:38.780
So to the beach, we went.

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:42.670
Wyatt, what ya doing? Were
