- [Hannah] Sweet brother, oh my gosh.

00:11:17.873 --> 00:11:19.583
Look at the sweetest brother.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:24.620
While I was saying yes
to the boys this week,

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:26.800
it really opened my eyes to the fact

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:30.400
that my mood sets the tone for the day.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.570
And if I'm taking care

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:35.514
of myself and taking
care of my mental health,

00:11:35.514 --> 00:11:39.290
I'm setting the tone for
the rest of my family.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:41.620
It really reminded me that my kids' needs

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:45.180
at the end of the day, their
core needs are very simple.

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:48.440
It's not this like wild,

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.800
grand gesture that makes them happy.

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:51.640
There are also all

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:54.610
of these small moments
that also make them happy.

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:55.960
So that's all for now.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:58.550
Let me know on Instagram what
you thought of this video.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:12:00.010
If you have any more fun ideas

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:02.600
for us to try while we're still together.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:04.640
If you'll please excuse us,

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:08.120
we got a lot of games going,
a lot of activities going.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.340
Who's this, your Western friend?

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:11.230
- Tom, Tom.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.550
- Tom.

00:12:12.550 --> 00:12:13.890
- Cowboy.

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:15.720
- Until next time, bye!

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:16.589
- Bye!

00:12:16.589 --> 00:12:18.340
_ Wyatt, you want to say bye?

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.255
